## Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) for local `wrangler dev` testing.
## CWA key: apply at https://opendata.cwa.gov.tw/user/authkey
CWA_API_KEY=your-cwa-api-key-here
## MOENV key: register at https://data.moenv.gov.tw/ then copy the API KEY from the member area
MOENV_API_KEY=your-moenv-api-key-here
